  "body": "Create your dream home on this prime 353sqm section in sought-after Long Bay. Offered as a land package only, this is an exciting opportunity to bring your vision to life in a desirable coastal setting.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a quiet street within a welcoming family community, this section offers potential coastal views and exceptional everyday convenience. Long Bay Village, Long Bay Beach, shops, cafes and local amenities are just a two-minute walk away, placing the best of coastal living on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nZoned for Long Bay College and Long Bay Primary School, both within walking distance, the location is ideal for growing families. A walkway to Long Bay College sits directly across the road, while nearby Ashley Park provides space for outdoor fun. Bus routes close by add further convenience for school, work and exploring the wider area.\r\n\r\nWith excellent access to schools, parks and the beach, Long Bay is a wonderful place to bring up a family. Secure this generous section and create a home that is uniquely yours.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/HLE3",
